1
00:00:05,126 --> 00:00:07,126
Shit— you're burning up.

2
00:00:34,002 --> 00:00:36,002
What's this mark?

3
00:00:45,752 --> 00:00:48,554
Earth, what kind of mark is this?

4
00:00:56,724 --> 00:00:58,724
It's nothing.

5
00:01:01,946 --> 00:01:04,566
Nothing?
Then what the hell is this mark?

6
00:01:08,798 --> 00:01:11,746
It's nothing. I'm just cold.

7
00:01:14,093 --> 00:01:15,291
That night—

8
00:01:18,106 --> 00:01:20,106
It was just the two of us in the room.

9
00:01:22,277 --> 00:01:24,277
And I didn't bring anyone else.

10
00:01:26,194 --> 00:01:28,194
Right?

11
00:01:33,427 --> 00:01:35,427
Earth…

12
00:01:35,778 --> 00:01:37,778
Tell me the truth.

13
00:01:40,339 --> 00:01:42,339
Was it…

14
00:01:45,563 --> 00:01:47,563
Was I the one who did this to you?

15
00:01:47,564 --> 00:01:49,564
What else do you want me to say?

16
00:01:53,801 --> 00:01:55,801
Isn't this clear enough?

17
00:01:58,486 --> 00:02:00,486
So…

18
00:02:01,639 --> 00:02:03,639
You and I…
